{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_spst_08-04",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "spst_08-04",
  "title": "燃燒的片段4",
  "storyCode": "EG-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c2771ec955dbff7550ef50fd43330fde15349c03992c6302d035efe747ac04f0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_topout"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太好。雖然留在下層的只有幾個魔族佬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他們都是身經百戰的雇傭兵，討厭得很，哪怕他們只有一顆螺絲釘，都能想出一百種廝殺的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "論作戰能力，我們半斤八兩，可論人數，我們只有他們的一半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，有沒有但是？我的腿已經快沒知覺了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有，“但是”雇傭兵內部的隊伍發生了分歧。至少外面有一部分是，眼下在我們樓底下的那群，不太清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這根本不算好消息，啊，痛......剛才那個傢伙下手真狠啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做了緊急處理就知足吧，想點別的事情，分散注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......上面越來越熱了。從剛才開始，上面的動靜都大得有點恐怖......而且，就，怎麼說呢，有點喘不過氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓你分散注意力，沒讓你去想這些事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿米婭，阿米婭她沒關係吧？還有那個龍門的警官，啊，雖然我只見過她一面......但一想到她們在對付......對付......呃，啥呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，你都開始胡言亂語了，看來血流得的確不少——慢著，有通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，我現在快抵達地面了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼情況？敵人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走大運了。剛才塔頂爆發出的法術像是火山爆發一樣吞沒了我們駐守的樓層，我們趁亂解決了幾個放哨的，剩下的只能選擇往下層的空地撤離——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為他們會死守這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許大家都有種預感，都清楚上面發生的事情正在超乎“戰術”範疇的預想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等......發生什麼了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓緊我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對......火，火蔓延開了！？這裡有什麼可燃物嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高溫......和情報說的一樣，這是塔露拉的伎倆......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別傻站著了！現在該怎麼辦！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——走這邊，和其他人會合！等等，你的腿沒事了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分散注意力！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_topout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認全部通訊，暫時沒有傷亡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別著急，那些雇傭兵可沒走遠，他們在確認事態，尋找機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在這座指揮塔因為塔頂突如其來的爆炸而陷入......短暫的平靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把這情形叫做平靜！？阿、阿米婭她們沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......就因為塔頂是這個情形，我才覺得我們這裡很安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總、總算——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要放鬆警惕，我們還——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼突然不說話了？喂——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看天上做什麼？塔頂有什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等，那、那是一個......光球？一團......一團火？光暈？那是啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！我做了記錄，從第一聲巨響開始，火焰和高溫氣流就衝垮了建築的穹頂，從塔的下方肉眼觀測，像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是落日的餘暉。\n像是前仆後繼的感染者之死。\n像是憤怒。\n像是這座將毀的城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我自以為比起你們不算個特別感性的人，但我大概知道你要說什麼，真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是屬於整合運動領袖的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高溫和火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但高溫和火......不該是這麼可怕的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那團光，那是一個人......兩個人，不，也許是更多、更多的憤怒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個就是......塔露拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，或者說，不止，遠遠不止。情報裡的那個整合運動領袖誰都知道，我實在無法把我現在看見的東西和那個年輕的龍聯繫起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上面......上面到底發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指揮塔裡還有其他人嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們得去幫他們！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！低頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——有敵人離開了指揮塔！去找他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "封鎖這裡，不要讓他們有尋援的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現、現在怎麼辦！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許我們該回去幫阿米婭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有阿米婭......只有阿米婭能做到。她能的。一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信她。我也只因為這個理由，才站在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她還答應過我，在帶薪休假的時候陪我逛街......當領袖的可不能食言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼在阿米婭凱旋之前，我們決不能放棄指揮塔。至少，撐到凱爾希醫生抵達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——喂，有什麼東西切開了天上的，呃，那玩意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你們聽見了嗎！？又是一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是劍？對了，那個龍門警官的確是用劍的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急促的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這、這是一把劍能發出的動靜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我去攔住指揮塔外的雇傭兵。你們回到塔裡，接應剩下的人，確保一條沒被摧毀的撤離道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一個人怎麼攔那麼多薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老練的羅德島幹員",
